    "What is your relationship with mathematics?": "Mathematics has always been a strong point for me, especially in chemistry and everyday problem-solving. I enjoy its logical structure and how it helps organize thought. Even in cooking or travel planning, math is quietly guiding decisions. I don’t consider myself a genius, but I appreciate how it simplifies complexity.",
